OL,3,ATeen who piloted Channel boat with 165
OL,4,Amigrants jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenager who piloted a dinghy
OL,7,Fcarrying a then-record 165 migrants
OL,8,Facross the English Channel to the UK
OL,9,Fhas been sentenced to two years and
OL,10,Fthree months in prison.
OL,12,FChan Mathok Atak, 19, from South Sudan,
OL,13,Fadmitted endangering others during a
OL,14,Fsea crossing on 23 July.
OL,16,FProsecutors at Canterbury Crown Court
OL,17,Fsaid Atak created a risk of death or
OL,18,Fserious personal injury to others on
OL,19,Fboard the boat.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
