OL,3,ATeen who piloted Channel boat with 165
OL,4,Amigrants jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt the time, the so-called "mega
OL,7,Fdinghy" set a record for the largest
OL,8,Fnumber of migrants brought over on a
OL,9,Fsmall boat in recent years. That figure
OL,10,Fhas since been surpassed with 230
OL,11,Fpeople on board a vessel in August.
